WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
And we are almost done, just five seconds left.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
We're switching off those jumping jacks next, that last exercise for this 50 second round.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.540
And switch it off, get those arms and legs moving.

4
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.600
This should be much, much easier than the last few exercises we were doing.

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.960
Remember this should be actually a little bit of a recovery phase compared to burpees

6
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.380
and those high knees.

7
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.220
So take your time, nice deep breaths, try to recover a little bit, try to get that lactic

8
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.220
acid out of those muscles and those legs and those arms.

9
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.060
Just keep those legs and arms moving, nice fluid motion, try to make sure you're still

10
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:55.660
keeping it quick.

11
00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.620
We've got just 10 seconds left till we get a nice long break.

12
00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:00.620
Remember we've got 20 second breaks coming up here.
